What this covers: everything in this repository that ROCKNIXDS made, including
libdsflip, its shaders, the installer, the tools, the stress ROMs and our
EmulationStation patches. Use it in your own projects, firmwares and forks.

What it doesn't cover (these keep their own terms):

- dii-ess-aye/overlay and dii-ess-aye/000*.patch change files of
  beebono/dii-ess-aye (https://github.com/beebono/dii-ess-aye), which has no
  license. The parts that come from it stay under its author's terms; our own
  additions in them are MIT like the rest.
- libdsflip is installed from SuperDrastic
  (https://github.com/JorreFog/SuperDrastic), MIT. Its third-party parts
  are listed in its THIRD_PARTY.md: rcheevos (MIT), stb (public domain or
  MIT), and ds-fsr.frag, which contains AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution 1.0:
  MIT, Copyright (c) 2021 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. (notice in the file).
- Fonts named in the README keep the SIL Open Font License.
